ll this being dereferenced as an offset into a struct inside _update_animation().\n\nException details:\nException Type:    EXC_BAD_ACCESS (SIGABRT)\nException Codes:   KERN_INVALID_ADDRESS at 0x00000000000005b1\nTermination:       SIGNAL 6 Abort trap: 6\nApplication info:  abort() called\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRough shape of the repro:\n\nOpen a project in the editor.\nSelect a node with an AnimationPlayer so the Animation dock is bound to it.\nFrom a script attached to a node in the same scene, in _physics_process(delta), call animation_player.stop() (or change/free it) under some condition.\nRun the scene from the editor.\nWhen the condition triggers, the editor crashes.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nnull","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119250/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/